					<description><![CDATA[Saturdays we catch up with the non-finance related items that we didn’t get to earlier in the week. You can check out...]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="links content-section"><h4 class="link-group-title">Autos</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/28/nx-s1-5918509/car-fuel-efficiency-cafe-standards-rollback" target="_blank">The Trump administration has weakened fuel efficiency standards for new cars. <span class="source">(npr.org)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.ft.com/content/796167ab-ba0b-4476-b505-516b7d896e40?syn-25a6b1a6=1" target="_blank">Ferrari ($RACE) stock is losing its premium valuation. <span class="source">(ft.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.austinvernon.site/blog/cybercab.html" target="_blank">A look at the design choices Tesla ($TSLA) has made with the Cybercab.  <span class="source">(austinvernon.site)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.betonit.ai/p/the-rideshare-revolution" target="_blank">Some simple math on autonomous taxis.  <span class="source">(betonit.ai)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Transport</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.notboring.co/p/airbound-as-we-may-move" target="_blank">How eVTOLs will change daily life.  <span class="source">(notboring.co)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.insurancejournal.com/news/international/2026/10/01/887351.htm" target="_blank">A third of new trucks in China are electric.  <span class="source">(insurancejournal.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Energy</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.ft.com/content/b84778e5-ce8b-4baa-9ca7-402cdf277b4d?syn-25a6b1a6=1" target="_blank">No matter how you slice it, China dominates the global battery market.  <span class="source">(ft.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/business/energy-oil/nevada-solar-industry-trump-states-b838c7e4?st=VrzSs2&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Nevada is aiming to become a solar energy powerhouse. <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.kqed.org/science/2002120/california-officially-legalizes-balcony-solar-opening-the-market-to-the-new-technology" target="_blank">California now allows balcony, i.e. plug-in, solar.  <span class="source">(kqed.org)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/28/opinion/power-grid-national-security.html?unlocked_article_code=1.E1E.7NJj.-PmIwNIQc6rv&smid=url-share" target="_blank">The grid needs to be hardened against hackers. <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">El Nino</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.theatlantic.com/science/2026/09/california-cost-falling-ocean/688759/?gift=TGgP34XZPBAppowZPOH7p5U3-1UTk_PvzBrWAZqxUCU&utm_source=copy-link&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=share" target="_blank">El Nino is doing a number on California's coast.  <span class="source">(theatlantic.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/30/climate/el-nino-storm-flooding-kelvin-waves.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FlE.-AT6.Tl48Ye91tvJC&smid=url-share" target="_blank">The California coast needs to brace for higher sea levels due to El Nino. <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Environment</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/22/stolen-passwords-are-exposing-americas-water-providers-to-hackers/" target="_blank">Why American water providers are uniquely at risk from hackers.  <span class="source">(techcrunch.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/01/climate/data-center-pollution-study-pennsylvania.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FVE.g6oy.IE5o4h-Ap4bf&smid=url-share" target="_blank">What happens when you put a bunch of data centers next to each other? <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://theconversation.com/antarcticas-ice-loss-is-locked-in-and-extra-snowfall-wont-save-it-thats-bad-news-for-low-lying-coastal-areas-elsewhere-293066" target="_blank">Just how much Antarctica's ice shelf has melted.  <span class="source">(theconversation.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/other/why-you-should-repair-your-phone-but-replace-your-dishwasher/ar-AA2daKgO" target="_blank">When does it make sense to repair vs. replace major items? <span class="source">(msn.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Travel</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.semafor.com/article/09/29/2026/decline-in-tourism-hits-us-economy" target="_blank">The World Cup didn't prevent a drop in visitors to the U.S.  <span class="source">(semafor.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://wapo.st/4z9I2it" target="_blank">The 50 best airports in America.  <span class="source">(wapo.st)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Technology</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/2026/11/data-center-resistance-movement/688671/?gift=TGgP34XZPBAppowZPOH7p15z7xTco6nzwZb9DgRhMGs&utm_source=copy-link&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=share" target="_blank">Data center opposition is bi-partisan. <span class="source">(theatlantic.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://slate.com/technology/2026/09/world-humanoid-games-robot-olympics.html" target="_blank">Why people love to watch robots fail.  <span class="source">(slate.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://sixcolors.com/post/2026/09/stolen-device-protection-passwords-glenn/" target="_blank">Why you should have Stolen Device Protection turned on. <span class="source">(sixcolors.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Behavior</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.twopct.com/p/why-we-keep-doing-things-we-hate" target="_blank">How the peak-end rule works.  <span class="source">(twopct.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://nextbigideaclub.com/magazine/behavioral-economist-explains-happiness-hard-bookbite/61496/" target="_blank">Five insights from George Loewenstein's new book, "The Opposite of Happiness: How Bad Feelings Make and Break Us." <span class="source">(nextbigideaclub.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://davidepstein.substack.com/p/make-it-through-the-worst" target="_blank">David Epstein, "The profound point here is that if the moment of peak desperation is interrupted, most people go on living." <span class="source">(davidepstein.substack.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Health</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://arstechnica.com/health/2026/09/fifth-unvaccinated-person-dies-of-measles-cdc-still-not-counting-all-deaths/" target="_blank">2026 is the worst year for measles since 1991. <span class="source">(arstechnica.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/health/healthcare/what-to-know-about-a-flu-season-without-a-flu-shot-push-1fd89e21?st=WzFpnQ&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Influenza is the eighth leading cause of death in America.  <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/health/diseases-and-conditions/long-flu-can-linger-for-months-here-s-how-to-reduce-your-risk/ar-AA2db9eK" target="_blank">Viral infections, like influenza, can affect you for months.  <span class="source">(msn.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/30/science/new-cancer-drugs-are-revolutionary-why-dont-more-patients-get-them.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FFE.mtRW.FCIx0I_e5j6w&smid=url-share" target="_blank">Why aren't more cancer patients getting biomarker testing? <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/09/260927034004.htm" target="_blank">An alternative to LASIK. <span class="source">(sciencedaily.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Fitness</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.smithsonianmag.com/science-nature/is-more-protein-always-better-despite-the-craze-around-the-nutrient-research-backed-evidence-about-its-benefits-is-complicated-180989584/" target="_blank">How to get your protein.  <span class="source">(smithsonianmag.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/09/260928100547.htm" target="_blank">More evidence in favor of creatine.  <span class="source">(sciencedaily.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/health/wellness/what-grip-strength-can-tell-you-about-your-health-abed3d8f?st=vj7maw&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Grip strength matters, but not for the reason you think.  <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Dogs</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/27/science/dogs-chasing-bears.html?unlocked_article_code=1.E1E.mHe-.E2yg7r43YGkm&smid=url-share" target="_blank">Don't count on your dog saving you from a bear.  <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2026/sep/22/sealook-netflix-seal-cartoon-pet-dogs-cats-transfixed" target="_blank">Why dogs like the Netflix ($NFLX) show 'Sealook.' <span class="source">(theguardian.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.ft.com/content/782f81e4-7eac-4791-b478-c142119a7ebb?syn-25a6b1a6=1" target="_blank">You don't need to bring your dog everywhere.  <span class="source">(ft.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Drink</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.kqed.org/news/12101534/california-farmers-are-struggling-to-sell-grapes-as-demand-for-wine-drops" target="_blank">California wine grape growers are up against it. <span class="source">(kqed.org)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://finance.yahoo.com/small-business/articles/californias-oldest-family-owned-winery-100000950.html" target="_blank">California's oldest family-run winery has filed for bankruptcy protection. <span class="source">(finance.yahoo.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.bnnbloomberg.ca/tariffs/2026/09/28/ottawa-distillery-looks-to-europe-as-us-import-ban-threatens-canadian-exports/" target="_blank">Canadian distillers are looking for non-US markets.  <span class="source">(bnnbloomberg.ca)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/02/dining/drinks/english-whisky-uk.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FlE.-9DU.JbpACSf4nVWw&smid=url-share" target="_blank">English whiskey is NOT Scotch.  <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Food</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/business/retail/why-kroger-is-trying-to-be-more-like-walmart-12963bdf?st=uHZJPb&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Kroger ($KR) wants to be more like Walmart ($WMT). <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/03/business/restaurants-glp1-weight-loss.html?unlocked_article_code=1.F1E.sUyK.LPpxH8Yk0Xhn&smid=url-share" target="_blank">How restaurants are adapting to the GLP-1 world. <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.ft.com/content/e41b609a-8762-43c2-bcfc-eaa61ec0cebf?syn-25a6b1a6=1" target="_blank">Cultivated meat makers are looking for new markets.  <span class="source">(ft.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/01/nx-s1-5978076/egg-prices-trump-affordability" target="_blank">Why egg prices are lower. <span class="source">(npr.org)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Sports</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/sports/brandon-mcnulty-world-championships-road-cycling-eff060b8?st=wtnGmx&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">An American, Brandon McNulty, won the road cycling World Championships. <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/02/nx-s1-5981420/kalshi-betting-prediction-markets-gambling-addiction" target="_blank">Problem gambling doesn't distinguish between sports books and prediction sites.  <span class="source">(npr.org)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://apnews.com/article/mlb-pitcher-fastball-velocity-records-401dff214338a9ab6bf2c9d92e158953" target="_blank">MLB pitchers have never thrown harder. <span class="source">(apnews.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Entertainment</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://stephenfollows.com/p/are-claims-of-mid-budget-movies-disappearing-true" target="_blank">On the death of the mid-budget movie. <span class="source">(stephenfollows.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/2026/10/01/hollywood-comedies-are-vanishing-where-did-they-go/" target="_blank">Where did all the big screen comedies go? <span class="source">(washingtonpost.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://stephenfollows.com/p/how-long-do-film-distributors-last" target="_blank">How long do film distributors last? <span class="source">(stephenfollows.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">College</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.theatlantic.com/international/2026/09/pete-hegseth-military-professors-tenure/688842/?gift=TGgP34XZPBAppowZPOH7p9m_mjipqgcVHPJoqeDXQGo&utm_source=copy-link&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=share" target="_blank">Hegseth continues his attack on the faculty of the military academies.  <span class="source">(theatlantic.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/us-news/education/college-tuition-cuts-costs-financial-aid-38e749df?st=4W5FLa&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Why some private colleges are cutting headline tuition rates.  <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://danieldrezner.substack.com/p/im-a-college-professor-writing-is?r=rjjdx" target="_blank">Why writing matters.  <span class="source">(danieldrezner.substack.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Children</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/google-ai-gemini-education-schools-1ec0972a?st=Yqbwb7&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">More students are outsourcing their thinking to AI.  <span class="source">(wsj.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/stop-spending-money-on-smaller-classes" target="_blank">What matters more? Smaller classes or better teachers? <span class="source">(noahpinion.blog)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=7535358" target="_blank">Why your neighbors matter for child outcomes.  <span class="source">(papers.ssrn.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Earlier on Abnormal Returns</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://abnormalreturns.com/2026/10/02/friday-links-access-to-retail-investors/" target="_blank">What you missed in our Friday linkfest. <span class="source">(abnormalreturns.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://abnormalreturns.com/signup" target="_blank">Don't miss a thing! Sign up for our daily e-mail newsletter. <span class="source">(abnormalreturns.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Mixed media</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.ft.com/content/db2ed7ac-3588-48d9-a3ae-7a64d3b72d14" target="_blank">A lot of entrepreneurs get a leg up with support from mom and dad.  <span class="source">(ft.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://frontofficesports.com/article/how-the-baseball-cap-became-a-behemoth/" target="_blank">How the baseball cap became a modern wardrobe staple. <span class="source">(frontofficesports.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/02/business/economy/tariffs-instruments-school-music-programs.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FlE.5VJ3.cD4ejpu2fj5i&smid=url-share" target="_blank">Rising instrument prices, due to tariffs, have pinched school music programs. <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li></ul></div>]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
			</item><item>
		<title>Friday links: access to retail investors</title>
		<link>https://abnormalreturns.com/2026/10/02/friday-links-access-to-retail-investors/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[abnormalreturns]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 17:17:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Links]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://abnormalreturns.com/?p=121950</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="links content-section"><h4 class="link-group-title">Rates</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://mrzepczynski.blogspot.com/2026/10/the-big-moves-in-fixed-income-getting.html" target="_blank">The rate move has been rapid.  <span class="source">(mrzepczynski.blogspot.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.axios.com/2026/10/02/bond-market-zig-zags-threaten-sp-500s-smooth-ride" target="_blank">Bond market volatility has ticked up quickly. <span class="source">(axios.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://trendlabs.com/what-if-interest-rates-keep-rising-into-the-2040s/" target="_blank">We aren't going back to a low interest rate world any time soon. <span class="source">(trendlabs.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">AI</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://giftarticle.ft.com/giftarticle/actions/redeem/a24b3ad2-15d2-4c08-84d5-06f7fa8ff361" target="_blank">On AI pricing: not all tokens are created alike. <span class="source">(giftarticle.ft.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/01/technology/ai-rogue-agents-liability.html?unlocked_article_code=1.FVE.j2cB.VULx9B_o53cU&smid=url-share" target="_blank">Why it's not simple to hold AI companies liable for their models.  <span class="source">(nytimes.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.axios.com/2026/09/29/the-future-is-ai-vs-ai" target="_blank">It's agent vs. agent: the new age of AI.  <span class="source">(axios.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cqx2z23xj555o" target="_blank">Betting the term 'super intelligence' takes off.  <span class="source">(bbc.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Sports business</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://genuineimpact.substack.com/p/the-weirdest-bull-market-you-havent" target="_blank">There is a bull market in racehorses. You can thank the OBBBA. <span class="source">(genuineimpact.substack.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://slate.com/culture/2026/10/college-football-sports-games-republicans-democrats.html" target="_blank">The Senate College Sports Bill is about paying players less. <span class="source">(slate.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://huddleup.substack.com/p/how-manchester-city-hid-1-billion" target="_blank">How Manchester City hid $1 billion. <span class="source">(huddleup.substack.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Stay in touch</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://abnormalreturns.com/signup" target="_blank">Don't miss a thing! Sign up for our daily e-mail newsletter. <span class="source">(abnormalreturns.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://talkingwealthpod.com/" target="_blank">Work in wealth management? Sign up for our exclusive Talking Wealth newsletter. <span class="source">(talkingwealthpod.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Iran</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.foreignaffairs.com/iran/new-forever-war-america-ali-vaez" target="_blank">The Iran war is at a stalemate.  <span class="source">(foreignaffairs.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.axios.com/2026/10/02/iran-trump-negotiations-war-reasons-fail" target="_blank">Why negotiations are going nowhere.  <span class="source">(axios.com)</span></a></li><li><a class="link" href="https://www.newyorker.com/news/q-and-a/why-the-war-in-iran-is-likely-to-heat-up-again" target="_blank">It's hard to see a path forward.  <span class="source">(newyorker.com)</span></a></li></ul><h4 class="link-group-title">Ukraine</h4><ul class="link-group"><li><a class="link" href="https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/ukraine-fires-hard-to-stop-ballistic-missile-for-first-time-d93138b4?st=QwPmrQ&reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink" target="_blank">Ukraine now has i